{
  "slug": "feynman",
  "name": "Feynman",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Auto-inject ASCII diagram rules into Claude Code prompts. Structure in your response gets a diagram without the developer asking.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 command** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `feynman` (Manage feynman ASCII diagram injection)\n- **Commands** (1): `opsx`\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install feynman@claude-community` from `apolenkov/feynman`.",
